 div class="oes-accordion">\n<h4><a href="#">Marking criteria </a></h4>\n<d
 iv class="oes-accordion-body">\n<p>There are no grades given for your Five
  Behaviours Questionnaire.</p>\n</div>\n<h4><a href="#">Submission details
 </a></h4>\n<div class="oes-accordion-body">\n<p>This assignment will be su
 bmitted through Canvas. When you are ready to submit your assignment\, sel
 ect the 'Start Assignment' button on this page and then scroll down to the
  'File Upload' tab where you can choose your file.</p>\n<p>If your assignm
 ent has multiple files\, select 'Add Another File' for each subsequent fil
 e <strong>before</strong> ticking the 'Agree' check box\, then select 'Sub
 mit Assignment'.</p>\n<p><strong>Please note:</strong> When you submit you
 r assignment through Canvas\, you are also submitting the assignment throu
 gh Turnitin. Turnitin is a text-matching service that compares your work w
 ith an international database of information sources. You will need to agr
