DESCRIPTION:This assignment will use a peer-evaluation system to help alloc
 ate the final grades for each individual member of the team: The team memb
 ers must assess the contribution/teamwork of all other team members in a p
 eer review system. A baseline mark will be established for all team member
 s based on the quality of the team deliverables. However\, each individual
  student will receive an individual mark\, in which the team mark will be 
 moderated based on their peer assessment. The individual student’s mark 
 may be moderated upwards from the team mark for superior peer assessment\,
  or downwards from the team mark for poor peer assessment. In an extreme c
 ase where a student makes zero contribution\, a mark of zero may be awarde
 d. Each individual student will only receive their individual mark. The pe
 er assessment is completely confidential and in no circumstances will the 
 peer assessments be disclosed to other team members. Detailed instructions
  for completing the peer assessments will be issued close to the end of th
 e course. The purpose of the peer assessment system is to ensure fairness 
 and encourage all team members to make their fair contribution to the work
  effort.\nGo to the FeedbackFruits activity in the course
