 --------------------\n\nThis assignment will be submitted through Canvas. 
 When you are ready to submit your assignment\, select the 'Start Assignmen
 t' button on this page and then scroll down to the 'File Upload' tab\, whe
 re you can choose your file.\n\nIf your assignment has multiple files\, se
 lect 'Add Another File' for each subsequent file before ticking the 'Agree
 ' check box\, then select 'Submit Assignment'.\n\nPlease note: When you su
 bmit your assignment through Canvas\, you are also submitting the assignme
 nt through Turnitin. Turnitin is a text-matching service that compares you
 r work with an international database of information sources. You will nee
 d to agree to use it.\n\n[Using Gen-AI ] (#)\n-------------------\n\nGener
 ative Artificial Intelligence\, or Gen-AI\, is a technology that is used t
 o generate text\, images\, data\, and videos in response to specific promp
 ts.\n\nCourse Coordinators will let you know where and when it is appropri
 ate to use Chatgpt or other Generative Artificial Intelligence software in
  assessments. As Gen-AI is not allowed in all assessments\, it is importan
 t to check the guidelines on the permitted use of software in assessment a
 ctivities. If you are unsure if you can use Gen-AI in a particular assessm
 ent\, please contact your Course Coordinator\n\nPlease remember your respo
 nsibility to uphold academic integrity. Submitting work for assessment tha
 t is not your own work is considered academic misconduct.\n\nFor more info
 rmation\, please see [Advice for students on using Generative Artificial I
 ntelligence] (https://www.auckland.ac.nz/en/students/forms-policies-and-gu
 idelines/student-policies-and-guidelines/academic-integrity-copyright/advi
 ce-for-student-on-using-generative-ai.html).\n\n[Assignment declaration ] 
 (#)\n-----------------------------\n\nUoA Online – Assessment Declaratio
 n and Statement of Authorship\n-------------------------------------------
 --------------------\n\nBefore submitting your assignment please ensure yo
 u have completed and understood the University of Auckland [Academic Integ
 rity Course] (https://www.auckland.ac.nz/en/students/forms-policies-and-gu
