 re-uploads-apse2.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/account_61990000000000001
 /attachments/18034557/prod-uoa-canvas-mobile.css"><p>The objective of this
  assignment is to implement your version of the "showdown_environment.py" 
 environment to enable a Reinforcement Learning agent to learn to competiti
 vely battle Pokémon in the Pokémon Showdown game. You are free to choose
  how you implement the environment\, using any methodology or resources on
 line that you wish.</p>\n<p>The core objective is to consider what informa
 tion is required for the agent and to get hands-on experience using machin
 e learning to solve a complex task. Your exploration into solving this pro
 blem will provide key insights into the material\, which you will demonstr
 ate in the report by explaining how you approached solving this complex ta
 sk with reinforcement learning and what you experienced along the way. Thi
 s is not a trivial task to learn - demonstrating that you can <em><strong>
 connect the dots in the lectures to the challenges you face throughout the
  assignment</strong></em> is what we are looking for.</p>\n<p>Full project
  details and implementation instructions are all found on the project GitH
